---
import '../styles/brain-intro.css';
---
<section id="intro" aria-label="神经节点交互开场">
  <canvas id="brain-surface" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <canvas id="brain-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="平视侧面三维大脑，左键拖动旋转，Shift 加左键拖动平移，双击复位"></canvas>
  <div class="intro-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header class="intro-header">
    <a class="intro-brand" href="/" aria-label="weegoto 首页"><span class="intro-orb"></span><span>weegoto<small>EEG · DEPRESSION</small></span></a>
    <div class="intro-header-right"><button id="skip-intro" class="quiet-btn">跳过动画 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
  </header>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> EXPLORING THE NEURAL LANDSCAPE</div>
    <h1>在神经之间，<br>寻找情绪的<span>线索。</span></h1>
    <p>从一次神经活动，到一段脑电信号。<br>探索 EEG 抑郁症识别背后的模型演进。</p>
    <button class="enter-btn" id="enter-intro"><span class="btn-dot"></span>激活中央节点<span class="enter-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    <div class="hero-footnote">一条信号，连接我们的研究之路</div>
  </div>
  <div class="brain-tag tag-top" aria-hidden="true"><i></i> LATERAL VIEW <span>真实脑皮层 · 平视视角</span></div>
  <div class="brain-tag tag-bottom" aria-hidden="true">NEURAL NETWORK <span>冰蓝脑皮层 · 空间节点</span></div>
  <button id="core-hit" class="cortex-hit" aria-label="点击脑皮层中央节点，放大大脑并进入时间线"><span class="core-ring"></span><span class="core-dot"></span><span class="core-tooltip">激活信号 <b>↗</b></span></button>
  <button id="core-hit-left" class="cortex-hit secondary-core" aria-label="激活左侧皮层节点"><span class="core-dot"></span></button>
  <button id="core-hit-right" class="cortex-hit secondary-core" aria-label="激活右侧皮层节点"><span class="core-dot"></span></button>
  <div class="brain-tools" aria-label="大脑拖动控制"><button type="button" data-motion="rotate" aria-pressed="true">↻ 旋转</button><button type="button" data-motion="pan" aria-pressed="false">↔ 移动</button><span></span><button type="button" id="reset-view">⟲ 复位</button></div>
  <div class="brain-instruction"><span class="instruction-cross" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><span id="drag-hint">左键拖动旋转 · Shift + 左键平移 · 点击光点进入</span></div>
  <div id="transition-copy" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span id="transition-kicker">NEURAL ACTIVATION</span><h2 id="transition-title">一次激活，一段信号。</h2><p id="transition-sub">从神经网络，走向脑电的时间结构</p></div>
  <footer class="intro-footer"><div class="intro-steps"><span class="step active" data-step="0"><b>01</b> 神经网络</span><i></i><span class="step" data-step="1"><b>02</b> 脑电信号</span><i></i><span class="step" data-step="2"><b>03</b> 研究时间线</span></div><span class="footer-code">BRAIN → SIGNAL → RESEARCH</span></footer>
  <div class="transition-track"><span id="transition-progress"></span></div>
</section>
<button id="replay-intro" class="replay-btn" hidden>↺ 重播开场</button>
<noscript><div style="position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1000;background:#070512;padding:15vh 8vw;color:#ece9f8">请启用 JavaScript 查看神经节点动画与交互时间线。</div></noscript>

<script>
  import '../scripts/brain-intro.js';
</script>
